<title>UK: SOCCER-HINCHCLIFFE CALLED INTO ENGLAND SQUAD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HINCHCLIFFE CALLED INTO ENGLAND SQUAD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England manager Glenn Hoddle called up uncapped Everton defender Andy Hinchcliffe on Sunday to the national squad for the opening World Cup qualifier against Moldova next weekend.</p>
<p>Left-back Hinchcliffe, 27, replaces Tottenham's Darren Anderton who has a recurring groin problem.</p>
